{
  "_readme": "Hand-written structure for DESIGN.md. It names which tokens each component uses; it never holds a value. Every value comes from src/tokens/tokens.json at build time (scripts/build-design-md.mjs). Token names here are the semantic keys in tokens.json (color-bg, radius-default, type-scale-xs). A component painted on a transparent background is listed on color-bg, the canvas it sits on by default, so the linter has a real pair to check. Where the demo draws one inside a Card or a Panel it also gets an entry ending in -on-surface, because surface is the harder background for coloured text and a pair that passes on the canvas can still fail there. Fill tokens never appear as a textColor: accent and danger as text go through color-text-accent and color-text-danger. Pairings were read from src/core/core.css and src/components/*.tsx; a pairing that code does not make does not belong here.",
